              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inera kwanata Ejakait EDEKE ebe: Naarai inerasi Moab ka Seir ebe, Koany, eputos ekek loka Yuda katekerin kere; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "asa koany, aŋaikini ewai loka Moab anyoun koreria, anyoun koreriake lukoikorunoke, aibuses naka akwap, Bet-yesimot, ka Baal-meon, ka Kiriataim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mama ejaas idwe lukokide, aitiji idwe luka Amon, ainakini kes araun airumet, tetere mam bobo iitunio idwe luka Amon katekerin, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atubokini Moab. Ejenunete do ebe arai eoŋ EJAKAIT,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
